---
import ResponsiveImg from '../../../../components/ResponsiveImg.astro';
import Arrow from '../../../../components/Arrow.astro';
---
<div class='intro'>
  <div class="container">
    <ResponsiveImg class="mobile-image display-none-desktop reveal-up" src="/assets/media/how-it-works.png" alt="Audio Tekne TFM-2000 tube amplifier" sizes="(min-width: 800px) 33vw, 100vw" />
    <h2 class="h2 text-align-left margin-top-desktop-0">Sell your used audio equipment in the greater NYC area & around Denver Colorado.</h2>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="container flex padding-bottom-4">
  <div class="copy autospacing">
    <p>StereoBuyers is a family-run business in New York City, specializing in buying pre-owned high-end stereo and home audio equipment like amplifiers, receivers, pre-amplifiers, CD Players and more. We also have an office in Denver, serving Colorado audiophiles.</p>
    <p>If you are a businesses or individual looking to scale back, offload, upgrade, or otherwise get rid of your pre-owned stereo equipment, let us pick up your equipment and components - and pay you immediately for it.</p>
    <p>
      <a class='text-turq text-uppercase tertiary-font' href='/how-to-sell-your-high-end-audio-equipment-and-components-with-StereoBuyers/'>
        How it works&nbsp;<span class="arrow"><Arrow /></span>
      </a>
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="image-container margin-top-0 display-none-mobile reveal-right">
    <ResponsiveImg class="image" src="/assets/media/how-it-works.png" alt="Audio Tekne TFM-2000 tube amplifier" sizes="(min-width: 800px) 33vw, 100vw" />
  </div>
</div>
<div class="background-color-white">
  <div class="container">
    <a href='/recent-press-articles-and-news/'>
      <blockquote class="blockquote small text-align-center">
        <div class="quote italic text-grey">
          “You can think of StereoBuyers as your high-end broker.”
        </div>
        <cite class="cite">~ Steve Guttenberg, CNET</cite>
      </blockquote>
    </a>
  </div>
</div>